{"results":[{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/raghav-utopia-malad-west-pid-21430","title":"Raghav Utopia in Malad West, Mumbai - PropertyPistol","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Malad West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-malad-west)\n10. /\n11. Raghav Utopia\n\n# Raghav Utopia\n\nFlats by **[Raghav Group](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-raghav-group)** at RAGHAV UTOPIA, New Shastri Nagar, Mitha Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nPR1180002501406\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR1.92 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR1.92 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2027\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area732 - 908\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 26.21 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nPR1180002501406\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/raghav-utopia-goregaon-west_mumbai-prjt-8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon West: Price, Photos & Floor Plans","raw_content":"![Raghav Utopia](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding%2F8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68%2Fimages%2F8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68_project_image_7yfYWUK6VK1763792474585_44863_iris_medium.jpg&w=3840&q=75)\n![back arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ArrowBackIOSWhite_rbReact_gtyg6.svg)\n![share](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-common%2FShareNew_react_443425.webp&w=48&q=75)\n![leftIcon1](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![leftIcon2](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![rightIcon2](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![rightIcon1](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/BigEllipse.svg)\n![Rera](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/reraProjectInfo.svg)\n\n# Raghav Utopia\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68/logo/8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68_logo_JCVUA8hXnO1763791665168.jpg)\n\n## By Raghav Group\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/ArrowForwardBlack_nbReact_453525.svg)\n![house](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/houseProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![boxProject](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/boxProjectInfo.svg)\n![frame](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/frameProjectInfo.svg)\n![claim](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-merchandise%2FclaimbenefitsIcon_nbReact221sor.webp&w=3840&q=75)\n![right](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowProjectInfo.svg)\n\n## Key Features\n\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Floor Plan\n\n## Amenities in Raghav Utopia\n\n![show more](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/greenDropDownIcn.svg)\n![show more](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/greenDropDownIcn.svg)\n\n## About the Raghav Utopia\n\n**Raghav Utopia offers luxurious housing in the heart of Mumbai, Maharashtra. Spread over 0.80 acres, with one tower and 80 units, featuring 2 and 3 BHK configurations, with carpet areas ranging from 732 sq. ft. to 908 sq. ft., the home layout promises a spacious lifestyle. Raghav Utopia prices range from Rs. 1.89 Crore to Rs. 2.41 Crore, providing an exceptional blend of elegance and contemporary urban living. The project offers well-curated amenities, including a jogging track, children’s play area, and serene sit-out zones, designed to elevate everyday living. With its strategic location and proximity to renowned schools, colleges, hospitals, and public transport, Raghav Utopia stands out as an ideal choice for modern families seeking convenience and refined living.**\n\n## **Raghav Utopia Overview**\n\n**Land area & units: 0.80 acres| 1 tower| 80 units**\n\n**Floors: G + 4P + 17 Floors**\n\n**Landmark & Nearby hub: Near Malad West Metro Station**\n\n**Possession Date: December 2029**\n\n**RERA Number: PR1180002501406**\n\n**Address: New Link Rd, Malad, Kanchpada, Goregaon West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400065**\n\n**Google Map: [Raghav Utopia location](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Raghav+UTOPIA+New+Launch+Project+Goregaon+West/@19.1901019,72.8354038,17z/data=!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x29fa2a41e32fda33:0xbb0eefd104ee4bb4!2sRaghav+UTOPIA+New+Launch+Project+Goregaon+West!8m2!3d19.1901382!4d72.8355478!10e5!16s%2Fg%2F11xsc_r6ss!3m5!1s0x29fa2a41e32fda33:0xbb0eefd104ee4bb4!8m2!3d19.1901382!4d72.8355478!16s%2Fg%2F11xsc_r6ss!5m1!1e1?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTEzMC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D)**\n\n## **Configuration and Price Ranges**\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Configuration | Carpet Area | Price |\n| 2 BHK | 732 sq. ft. | On Request |\n| 3 BHK | 908 sq. ft. | On Request |\n\nConfiguration \n\nCarpet Area\n\nPrice\n\n2 BHK\n\n732 sq. ft.\n\nOn Request\n\n3 BHK\n\n908 sq. ft.\n\nOn Request\n\n## **Why invest?**\n\n**Well-connected location: Raghav Utopia’s location has excellent connectivity to major roads, educational institutions, hospitals, and public transport, ensuring seamless daily commuting and strong long-term value appreciation.**\n\n**Boutique community: With only 80 homes in a single tower, Raghav Utopia offers a low-density, peaceful living environment, ensuring greater privacy, exclusivity, and a premium residential experience.**\n\n**Spacious, well-designed homes: Raghav Utopia apartments are thoughtfully planned to maximise usable space, natural light, and ventilation, providing a comfortable, functional lifestyle for modern families.**\n\n## **Amenities Offered at Raghav Utopia**\n\n**Raghav Utopia amenities are designed for everyday comfort, relaxation, and community living.**\n\n### **Leisure Zone**\n\n**Common Garden**\n\n### **Kids’ Area**\n\n**Children's Play Area**\n\n### **Active Living Hubs**\n\n**Jogging Track**\n\n**Gym**\n\n**Swimming Pool**\n\n### **Social Space**\n\n**Community Hall**\n\n## **Location and Connectivity**\n\n**Raghav Utopia is located in [Goregaon West,](https://www.nobroker.in/new-projects-in-goregaon-west-mumbai) Mumbai.**\n\n**Goregaon West is a well-established, rapidly developing residential locality in Mumbai, known for its strong connectivity, modern social infrastructure, and a balanced urban lifestyle. Its proximity to the Western Express Highway, metro stations, business hubs, reputable schools, malls, and healthcare facilities provides a convenient, family-friendly living environment.**\n\n**Aquinas International School: 3.6 km**\n\n**Rishi Valmiki Eco School: 4 km**\n\n**VIBGYOR High School: 4.8 km**\n\n**Vivek College Of Commerce: 4.5 km**\n\n**Ravindra Bharati College: 4.8 km**\n\n**H K Institute Of Management Studies & Research: 4.9 km**\n\n**Prarthana Hospital and ICU: 3.1 km**\n\n**Oscar Superspeciality Hospital: 3.5 km**\n\n**Kapadia Multispecialty Hospital: 3.9 km**\n\n**Infiniti Mall: 900 m**\n\n**Malad West Metro Station: 600 m**\n\n**Malad Railway Station: 2.4 km**\n\n## **Construction & Delivery Timeline**\n\n**Raghav Utopia is under construction, with an expected possession date of December 2029.**\n\n## **Summary**\n\n**Raghav Utopia offers spacious, premium 2 and 3 BHK homes in an exclusive low-density community with modern amenities and excellent connectivity.**\n\n### **Pros**\n\n**Spacious, efficient layouts offering comfort, ventilation, and modern family convenience.**\n\n**Quality amenities supporting wellness, recreation, and community engagement.**\n\n### **Cons**\n\n**Limited amenities compared to larger township-style developments.**\n\n**Possession by 2029 - Not ideal for immediate buyers.**\n\n## Raghav Utopia - RERA & Legal Certificates\n\n![view](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Eye.svg)\n\nThe Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 is Act of the Parliament of India...\n\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![approved](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rera_approved_seal.png)\n![Timely Dispute Resolution](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Question.svg)\n![Quality Assurance](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/SealCheck.svg)\n![Buyer Protection](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ShieldCheck.svg)\n![Transparency & Tracking](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/FileMagnifyingGlass.svg)\n\n## Raghav Utopia - Neighbourhood\n\n## Compare Projects\n\n## Price Trend for Raghav Utopia\n\n## Top Developers in Mumbai\n\n## Builders\n\nNo builders found\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Where is Raghav Utopia located?\n\n### What is the available Apartment size in Raghav Utopia?\n\n### What is the RERA Number of Raghav Utopia of Goregaon West?\n\n### What is the price range of Raghav Utopia of Goregaon West?\n\n### Where to download the Raghav Utopia brochure?\n\n### Where to download the Raghav Utopia floor plan?\n\n### What is the nearest landmark to Raghav Utopia residential project?\n\n### What amenities are available at Raghav Utopia residential project?\n\n### Does Raghav Utopia residential project have covered car parking?\n\n### Which banks can approve loans for Raghav Utopia residential project?\n\n### Is a transportation facility easily available near Raghav Utopia residential project?\n\n![chat](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/Common/chatLightBg.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\n## About the Builder\n\n![Raghav Group Logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68/logo/8a9f9184994bc29401994c06ac411b68_logo_JCVUA8hXnO1763791665168.jpg)\n\n### Raghav Group\n\nRAGHAV Group aims to build quality and thoughtful homes for everyone. The Founder, Mr. Sudhanshu Agarwal, has been associated with various Real Estate Groups and MNCs, having a decade long experience in managing diversified businesses. He has been instrumental in executing various projects across the skyline of Mumbai.\nOur geographical spread over the states of Maharashtra, Gujarat & Rajasthan helps us add to our strengths and gives a diversified outlook to our business.\n\n## Raghav Utopia - Neighbourhood\n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Goregaon West Area\n\n![Siroya FM Deshabhimani](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![K Anand New Bhagyashree CHS](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Sushanku Avenue 37](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Sushanku Codename Big Bonanza](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Andrades Krutartha](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![SD Ekta Suprabhat CHS](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Prince Krishna Kunj](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![Khodiyaar Siddharth Nagar Goodwill Chsl](http