0);)\n\n![Raghav Utopia  Banner](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1763444001.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Raghav Group Developer](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nRaghav Group\n\nDeveloper\n\n![Goregaon West, Mumbai Location](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\n# About Raghav Utopia Project\n\n**Raghav Utopia Goregaon West Mumbai** is a residential project by **Raghav Group** situated in the premium location of Goregaon West, Mumbai, Shastri Nagar, offering **2 & 3 BHK** flats with availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheets, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities, and Specifications. Utopia by Raghav Group has an **Exclusive Tower** of **G + 20 Storeys**. Raghav Goregaon West has 2 BHK & 3 BHK configuration with **carpet area**  2 BHK is 732 sq.ft  **Price** starts ₹ 2.15 Cr\\* and 3 BHK with a carpet area of 908 sq.ft - ₹ 2.75 Cr\\*Onwards. Utopia Mumbai Raghav **RERA No**.PR1180002501406, Raghav Mumbai Utopia  property focuses on proper design & layout in accordance with the rules of Vastu.\n\nRaghav Goregaon West has **Excellent Connectivity** Western Express Highway - ( 5 mins), Metro Station - (10 mins), International Airport - (20 mins), St. John’s Universal, Vibgyor High School, Patkar College, Mithibai College, Kokilaben Hospital, SRV Hospital, Lifeline Medicare, Jama Masjid (10 mins), Inorbit Mall, Oberoi Mall, Infinity Mall.\n\nUtopia Mumbai Raghav **Address -** Shastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n\nRaghav Goregaon West has Amenities like Fully equipped gymnasium, fitness center, Jogging track, yoga, meditation zones, Multipurpose hall, Jogging track, yoga, meditation zone, and Swimming pool with sun deck and 24×7 Surveillance.\n\nRaghav Mumbai Goregaon West has **Internal Features** like sliding windows with mosquito net and invisible safety grill, Sliding door or foldable door for terraces, Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet, Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink, Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring, and Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\nRaghav Utopia has **Ongoing, Upcoming, and Completed Projects .**\n\nThe Ongoing and Upcoming Projects are Raghav Nova - Kurla East, Raghav Marvel - Kurla East, Raghav Parijat - Kurla East, Raghav Enclave - Kurla East, Raghav Vista - Chembur, Raghav Paradise - Borivalli\n\nThe Completed Projects are Raghav One - Kurla East, Raghav One 45 - Kurla East, and Raghav Amara - Kurla East.\n\n![_ Elevation Image](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1763443802.jpg)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nRaghav Utopia\n\n![Location](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n![Developer Name](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1729333232.svg)\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nRaghav Group\n\n![TOTAL TOWERS](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871433.svg)\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\n![FLOORS](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871419.svg)\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 4P + 17 Storey\n\n![APARTMENTS](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871403.svg)\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\n2 & 3 BHK\n\n![AREA](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871390.svg)\n\nAREA\n\n732 - 908 Sqft\n\n![POSSESSION](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871368.svg)\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![RESEDENTIAL](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/image1678871349.svg)\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty\n\n## Raghav Utopia Property Specification\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Lifestyle amenities like Swimming Pool and Gym |\n| 2 & 3 BHK Balcony homes with ample of Sunlight and with good Ventilation |\n| Utopia near Western Express Highway by 5 mins |\n| Assured Rental Income till Possession and No Floor Rise |\n| G + 4P + 17 floors Iconic tower with Balcony View Homes and Podium Carpark |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Raghav Utopia\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|\n| 2 BHK | 732 Sqft | ₹ 2.15 Cr\\* |\n|\n| 3 BHK | 908 sq.ft | ₹ 2.75 Cr\\* |\n\n## Raghav Utopia Floor Plan\n\n## Raghav Utopia Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Elevation-Image](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Elevation-Image-18112025054454.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Elevation-Image\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Lobby-Area](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Lobby-Area-18112025054534.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Lobby-Area\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Master-Bedroom](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Master-Bedroom-18112025054556.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Master-Bedroom\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Living-Area](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Living-Area-18112025054623.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Living-Area\n\n![Raghav-Utopia-Kitchen-Area](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Kitchen-Area-18112025054645.jpg)\n\nRaghav-Utopia-Kitchen-Area\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Fully equipped gymnasium\n* Fitness center\n* Jogging track\n* Yoga\n* Meditation zones\n* Multipurpose hall\n* Jogging track\n* Swimming pool with sun deck and 24×7 Surveillance\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* 2 or 3 track sliding windows with mosquito net and invisible safety grill\n* Sliding door or foldable door for terraces\n* Glass railing for terrace & balcony. Kitchen - Dado tiles above the platform up to 2 feet\n* Granite body tile kitchen platform with Stainless steel sink\n* Flooring - Vitrified tile flooring\n* and Anti-skid tile flooring in toilets. Concealed plumbing and Jaguar fittings.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/Raghav-Utopia-Developer-Name_-18112025055042.jpg)\n\n## Raghav Group\n\nRaghav Real Estate Group, also known as Raghav Group or Raghav Realty, is an emerging and growing real estate developer primarily active in Mumbai.  Raghav Group focuses mainly on residential developments and has delivered numerous 1, 2, and 3 BHK projects, especially in locations like Kurla and Borivali. Raghav Group has completed and ongoing projects such as Raghav Enclave, Raghav Nova, Raghav Marvel, Raghav Parijat, and Raghav Paradise. Trust, transparency, safety, and timely delivery, the group's positions a customer-focused developer offering quality homes. Raghav Real Estate Group aims to provide affordable and premium lifestyle spaces.\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Raghav Utopia Construction Status\n\n## Raghav Utopia Location\n\n## Raghav Utopia Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nShastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n## Raghav Utopia MahaRera\n\n[![PR1180002501406](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/PR1180002501406_-18112025072045.jpg)](javascript:void(0);) \n\nPR1180002501406\n\nThe website project is registered under  [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\n[Who is Raghav Real Estate Group?](#collapse0)\n\nRaghav Real Estate Group is a growing real estate developer known for delivering quality residential projects across Mumbai and Maharashtra. They focus on trust, transparency, and timely construction.\n\n[What types of projects does Raghav Group develop?](#collapse1)\n\nRaghav Group primarily develops residential properties, including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK apartments in well-connected areas of Mumbai.\n\n[What amenities does Raghav Real Estate Group provide?](#collapse2)\n\nDepending on the project, amenities may include landscaped gardens, modern security systems, fitness centers, children’s play areas, and parking facilities.\n\n[What is the RERA No of Raghav Utopia Project?](#collapse3)\n\nThe RERA No of Raghav Utopia Project is PR1180002501406\n\n[What is the Address of Raghav Utopia Project ?](#collapse4)\n\nThe address of Raghav Utopia Group is Shastri Nagar, Road No. 1, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n[![Raghav Utopia ](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583) \n\n[![Raghav Utopia ](https://raghavutopia-goregaon.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583)  The information provided on this website is intended exclusively for informational purposes and should not be construed as an offer of services. This site is managed by a RERA authorized real estate agent namely Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited (Registered Agent bearing RERA No: A51700026634).\n\nThis website is a digital promotional showcase managed by\n\n#### **Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited**,\n\nan independent, MahaRERA-registered real estate agent bearing\n\n#### **MahaRERA Real Estate Agent Registration No. A51700026634**.\n\nThe project showcased herein, **Raghav Utopia**, is a registered real estate project developed by **Raghav Group**, bearing **MahaRERA Project Registration Number:** PR1180002501406. All project-related particulars, including specifications, configurations, dynamic floor plans, and layout designs, are provided for consumer awareness and initial guidancee.\n\nThe text, representations, layout diagrams, and computer-generated mockups or images used on this portal are artist impressions and are indicative only. The final terms, pricing structure, dynamic stock availability, and specific project timelines are subject to change as per the promoter/developer’s updates or market modifications. In strict alignment with the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA), all buyers are encouraged to independently verify all verified files, sanctioned building plans, and project progress statuses on the official MahaRERA website at <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in> under the registered project number before making any booking or financial commitment.\n\nDigipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited functions purely as an authorized sourcing/facilitating partner and shall not be held liable for any unilateral alterations made by the developer to the underlying layout or project construct.","images":[]},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/raghav-utopia","title":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon west- Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","raw_content":"Raghav Utopia Goregaon west- Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Goregaon West](/in/mumbai/goregaon-west)\n\nLast updated: Jul 15, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715173962-291882427-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715174817-351607770-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715175503-184987456-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715176225-781765907-1280w.webp)\n\n# Raghav Utopia Goregaon west\n\n[By Raghav Group](/builder/raghav-group)|\n\nShastri Nagar, [Goregaon West](/in/mumbai/goregaon-west)\n\n₹2.20 Cr - 2.78 Cr All inc.\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715173962-291882427-1280w.webp)\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715174817-351607770-1280w.webp)\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715175503-184987456-1280w.webp)\n\n![Raghav Utopia Goregaon west - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715176225-781765907-1280w.webp)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Raghav Utopia\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Goregaon West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Raghav Utopia\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Goregaon West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n0.19 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+4P+17\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n721-908 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPR1180002501406\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nEarly Stage (2-3 yrs)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2028\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2029\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Raghav Utopia\n\nRaghav Goregaon West Project Overview  \nRaghav Utopia Project will be constructed on 0.19 acre of land parcel, 1 tower with G+4P+17 floors having 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nRaghav Utopia location  \nProject is Located Near New Link Rd, Shashtri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai with -  \nBangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m  \nSV Rd - 900m  \nWEH - 2.9km  \n  \nRaghav Utopia Goregaon West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Intercom, Kitchen Platform, CCTV & many more  \n  \nRaghav Realty Goregaon West External Amenities  \nProject has amenities with likes of -  \nInfinity Swimming Pool  \nGymnasium  \nKids play Area  \nYoga Deck  \nSenior Citizen Area many more  \n  \nRaghav Realty Utopia Goregaon West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nRaghav Utopia Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2029  \nTarget Possession - December 2028  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nRaghav Utopia project has 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n2BHK - (721 to 732) sqft  \n3BHK - (884 to 908) sqft  \n  \nRaghav Utopia floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 5 flats, 3 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nUtopia Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Raghav Utopia Goregaon West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Raghav Realty Goregaon West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Location\n\nNear New Link Rd, Shastri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n* Bangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m\n* S.V. Rd - 900m\n* WEH - 2.9km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Videos\n\n## Raghav Utopia Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is located at a prime location near New Link Road, offering excellent connectivity to Bangur Nagar Metro Station, Oberoi Mall, and the Western Express Highway.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project offers relatively small carpet areas, especially in the 2 & 3 BHK layouts. So, if you are looking for spacious apartments, this project may not be the right fit for you.\n\n## Raghav Utopia Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![CCTV Camera](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/cctv-camera_External_1770712182845-897978997.webp)\n\nCCTV Camera\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Yoga Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447479516-img.webp)\n\nYoga Zone\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Multi purpose hall](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/multi-purpose-hall_External_1770717854977-274652141.webp)\n\nMulti purpose hall\n\n## Raghav Utopia Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Raghav Utopia Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1775715179454-582431966-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Raghav Utopia Floor Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/raghav-utopia_1765452631453-396389258-1280w.webp)\n\n## Raghav Utopia Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 721 sqftLimited | 2.20 Cr All In | 33.00 Lacs | 1 |\n| 732 sqft | 2.20 Cr All In | 33.00 Lacs | 1 |\n\nCarpet:721 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 721 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/image_0_1765452855796-324594880.webp)\n\n2.20 CrAll Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n33.00 Lacs\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n1Parking\n\nLimited\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\nCarpet:732 sqft\n\n## Raghav Utopia Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Raghav Utopia Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nNo\n\n## Documents For Raghav Utopia\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRaghav Utopia Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?u