, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Raghav Utopia starts from **₹2.75 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **884 sq. ft.** – ₹2.75 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **908 sq. ft.** – ₹2.78 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.19 acres** with **1** towers with **G+4P+17** floors. Each floor has **5** flats per floor, **3** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **721** to **908 sq. ft.**\n\nRaghav Utopia provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Raghav Utopia project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Near New Link Rd, Shastri Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Bangur Nagar Metro Stn - 550m**   \n**• S.V. Rd - 900m**   \n**• WEH - 2.9km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹33.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Raghav Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **10 years** of experience and more than **9 completed projects** across **Mumbai City, Mumbai suburban and Pune**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Raghav Reserve** in Chikhali, Pune  \n  \n • **Raghav Ananta** in Vikhroli East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Raghav Avenue** in Chembur East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Raghav Vista** in Kurla East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Raghav Enclave** in Kurla East, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Goregaon West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Raghav Group** - with 10 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK at ₹2.20 Cr to ₹2.78 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying 